{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-forge",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "插件创建插件：声明式 spec → 完整可构建的 DSH 插件项目（8 件：src/index.ts + package.json + tsconfig + cordis.patch.yml + README + docs/semantic.md + tests/smoke.test.mjs + .gitignore）。对齐《DSH 插件生态倡议书》三条原则并落成可机械验证的闸门：声明清晰（inject 静态对账 + dshForge 静态声明）、组合优先（拒绝跨插件内部路径导入）、兼容优先（依赖准备不制造 @deepseek-ai 遮蔽）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/types/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.1-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "^0.1.0-rc.6"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^22.0.0",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "test": "node --test \"tests/*.test.mjs\"",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit"
  }
}
